  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #5750, eff 12-1-93; ss by #7135, eff 11-23-99; ss by #7342, eff 10-1-00; ss by #9276, eff 10-1-08; ss by #12015, eff 10-25-16; ss by #14652, eff 7-17-26, EXPIRES: 7-17-36",
